This page's one anchor carries an extras object a path can address and — because
`[[task.anchor.number]]` selects it — the public numbering fields. A row is built
from the projected fields the renderer sees, so `number.raw` is reachable by
`include` / `only` / `preset = "all"` and by nothing else: it is not in the
`pendon` preset.

